    "custom_content_3kjdhd": {
      "type": "scale-o-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_any_1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "What is Scale-O and how does it work?",
            "answer": "<p>Scale-O is a salt-free water softener for Indian homes with overhead tanks. Place the compact unit inside your tank. As water flows through the home, it conditions minerals and helps reduce hard-water scale on pipes, fittings and household appliances, without salt, electricity or plumbing changes.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_any_2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Is Scale-O a salt-free water softener?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Scale-O is salt-free, with no salt bags, no refill hassle and no regeneration waste. Compare <a href=\"/blogs/articles/salt-free-vs-salt-based-water-softeners\">salt-free vs salt-based water softeners</a> for Indian homes, or see <a href=\"/pages/water-softener-plans\">water softener price and plans</a>.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_any_3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Does Scale-O waste water like salt-based softeners?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Scale-O does not backwash or discharge water during regeneration. You get scale protection without the water wastage common in many salt-based systems. Read more in <a href=\"/blogs/articles/salt-free-vs-salt-based-water-softeners\">salt-free vs salt-based water softeners</a>.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_any_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "How does the Scale-O trial / guarantee work?",
            "answer": "<p>Scale-O offers a 7-day risk-free trial so you can try salt-free hard-water protection at home. Guarantee activation is confirmed with your invoice. Chat on WhatsApp from this page if you need help choosing a tank size.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_any_5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Does a water softener reduce hair fall from hard water?",
            "answer": "<p>Hard water hair fall in India is often breakage from mineral film, not medical shedding. A salt-free water softener in the overhead tank can help hair feel less dry. Scale-O does not claim to stop balding. See <a href=\"/blogs/articles/hard-water-hair-breakage-vs-shedding\">hard water hair fall guide</a>.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_any_6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Can I install a water softener in an overhead tank without a plumber?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Scale-O is a DIY water softener for overhead tanks: open the lid, place the unit inside, close and use water normally. No plumber, drain or electricity. Read the <a href=\"/blogs/articles/best-overhead-tank-water-softener-india\">overhead tank water softener</a> guide.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_mini_1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "mini",
            "question": "What is Scale-O Mini salt-free water softener for 500L-750L tanks?",
            "answer": "<p>Scale-O Mini is a compact salt-free water softener designed for smaller overhead tanks (about 500L-750L). It helps reduce hard-water scale across taps, bathrooms and appliances without salt or electricity. Shop <a href=\"/products/mini-water-softener-500l-750l-tanks\">Scale-O Mini</a> or compare all sizes in the <a href=\"/collections/water-softeners\">water softener for home</a> collection.</p>",
            "category": "Mini"
          }
        },
        "faq_mini_2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "mini",
            "question": "Is Scale-O Mini right for my overhead tank size?",
            "answer": "<p>Choose Mini when your overhead tank is roughly 500L-750L. Larger tanks usually need <a href=\"/products/semi-water-softener-1000l-1500l-tanks\">Scale-O Semi (1000L-1500L)</a> or <a href=\"/products/centi-water-softener-2000l-2500l-tanks\">Scale-O Centi (2000L-2500L)</a>. For two tanks, see <a href=\"/pages/water-softener-plans\">water softener combo plans</a>.</p>",
            "category": "Mini"
          }
        },
        "faq_mini_3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "mini",
            "question": "How do I install Scale-O Mini in an overhead tank?",
            "answer": "<p>Open the tank, place Scale-O Mini inside, close the lid and use water as usual. No plumber or wiring. Learn more about <a href=\"/blogs/articles/best-overhead-tank-water-softener-india\">overhead tank water softener</a> installs for Indian homes.</p>",
            "category": "Mini"
          }
        },
        "faq_mini_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "mini",
            "question": "Will Scale-O Mini protect geysers, washing machines and bathrooms?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Once Mini is in the overhead tank, conditioned water can reach bathrooms, kitchen and appliances. Hard water can also affect hair feel; see <a href=\"/blogs/articles/hard-water-hair-breakage-vs-shedding\">hard water hair fall: breakage vs shedding</a>.</p>",
            "category": "Mini"
          }
        },
        "faq_mini_5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "mini",
            "question": "Mini vs Semi vs Centi: which salt-free softener should I buy?",
            "answer": "<p>Match tank capacity: <a href=\"/products/mini-water-softener-500l-750l-tanks\">Mini (500L-750L)</a>, <a href=\"/products/semi-water-softener-1000l-1500l-tanks\">Semi (1000L-1500L)</a>, <a href=\"/products/centi-water-softener-2000l-2500l-tanks\">Centi (2000L-2500L)</a>. Compare pricing on <a href=\"/pages/water-softener-plans\">Water Softener Price and Plans</a>.</p>",
            "category": "Mini"
          }
        },
        "faq_mini_6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "mini",
            "question": "Is Scale-O Mini enough for a 500 litre overhead tank?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Scale-O Mini is a salt-free water softener for 500L-750L overhead tanks, common in 1-3 member homes. If your tank is closer to 1000L, choose <a href=\"/products/semi-water-softener-1000l-1500l-tanks\">Semi</a> instead.</p>",
            "category": "Mini"
          }
        },
        "faq_semi_1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "semi",
            "question": "What is Scale-O Semi salt-free water softener for 1000L-1500L tanks?",
            "answer": "<p>Scale-O Semi is a salt-free water softener built for mid-size overhead tanks (about 1000L-1500L), common in many Indian homes. It helps reduce hard-water scale without salt, electricity or plumbing. View <a href=\"/products/semi-water-softener-1000l-1500l-tanks\">Scale-O Semi</a> or the full <a href=\"/collections/water-softeners\">water softener for home</a> range.</p>",
            "category": "Semi"
          }
        },
        "faq_semi_2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "semi",
            "question": "Is Scale-O Semi suitable for whole-house hard water protection?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Treating water at the overhead tank helps protect bathrooms, kitchen lines and appliances fed from that tank. For smaller tanks see <a href=\"/products/mini-water-softener-500l-750l-tanks\">Mini</a>; for larger tanks see <a href=\"/products/centi-water-softener-2000l-2500l-tanks\">Centi</a>.</p>",
            "category": "Semi"
          }
        },
        "faq_semi_3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "semi",
            "question": "How is Scale-O Semi installed in an overhead tank?",
            "answer": "<p>DIY install: open the tank, place Semi inside, close and use water normally. No electrician or salt plant. Read our guide on <a href=\"/blogs/articles/best-overhead-tank-water-softener-india\">overhead tank water softener</a> setups.</p>",
            "category": "Semi"
          }
        },
        "faq_semi_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "semi",
            "question": "When should I choose Semi instead of Mini or Centi?",
            "answer": "<p>Pick Semi for ~1000L-1500L tanks. Prefer Mini for 500L-750L or Centi for 2000L-2500L. Need two tanks? Check <a href=\"/pages/water-softener-plans\">combo softener plans</a> and <a href=\"/blogs/articles/salt-free-vs-salt-based-water-softeners\">salt-free vs salt-based</a> options.</p>",
            "category": "Semi"
          }
        },
        "faq_semi_5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "semi",
            "question": "Does Scale-O Semi need maintenance or salt refills?",
            "answer": "<p>No daily salt refill or power. Units are typically exchanged on a scheduled cycle so protection stays consistent. See product details and <a href=\"/pages/water-softener-plans\">water softener price and plans</a> for exchange options.</p>",
            "category": "Semi"
          }
        },
        "faq_semi_6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "semi",
            "question": "Which water softener is right for a 4 to 6 member family?",
            "answer": "<p>Most 4 to 6 member Indian homes with a 1000L-1500L overhead tank choose <a href=\"/products/semi-water-softener-1000l-1500l-tanks\">Scale-O Semi</a>. Smaller 500L-750L tanks use <a href=\"/products/mini-water-softener-500l-750l-tanks\">Mini</a>; 2000L+ tanks use <a href=\"/products/centi-water-softener-2000l-2500l-tanks\">Centi</a>.</p>",
            "category": "Semi"
          }
        },
        "faq_centi_1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "centi",
            "question": "What is Scale-O Centi salt-free water softener for 2000L-2500L tanks?",
            "answer": "<p>Scale-O Centi is the larger salt-free water softener for bigger overhead tanks (about 2000L-2500L). It helps reduce hard-water scale across the home without salt or electricity. Shop <a href=\"/products/centi-water-softener-2000l-2500l-tanks\">Scale-O Centi</a> or browse <a href=\"/collections/water-softeners\">all water softeners</a>.</p>",
            "category": "Centi"
          }
        },
        "faq_centi_2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "centi",
            "question": "Is Centi the right overhead tank water softener for large homes?",
            "answer": "<p>Choose Centi when tank capacity is roughly 2000L-2500L or daily use is higher. Smaller homes often use <a href=\"/products/mini-water-softener-500l-750l-tanks\">Mini</a> or <a href=\"/products/semi-water-softener-1000l-1500l-tanks\">Semi</a>. Compare sizes on <a href=\"/pages/water-softener-plans\">Water Softener Price and Plans</a>.</p>",
            "category": "Centi"
          }
        },
        "faq_centi_3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "centi",
            "question": "How do I install Scale-O Centi without a plumber?",
            "answer": "<p>Place Centi inside the overhead tank. No plumbing cut-in or electrical work. Learn more about <a href=\"/blogs/articles/best-overhead-tank-water-softener-india\">overhead tank water softener</a> installation for Indian houses.</p>",
            "category": "Centi"
          }
        },
        "faq_centi_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "centi",
            "question": "Will Centi help reduce scale on taps, tiles and appliances?",
            "answer": "<p>Centi helps reduce hard-water scale formation on fittings and water-using appliances fed from the treated tank. Pair with good habits at home; for hair concerns see <a href=\"/blogs/articles/hard-water-hair-breakage-vs-shedding\">hard water and hair fall</a>.</p>",
            "category": "Centi"
          }
        },
        "faq_centi_5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "centi",
            "question": "Centi vs Semi: which salt-free softener for my tank?",
            "answer": "<p>Semi fits ~1000L-1500L; Centi fits ~2000L-2500L. Undersizing reduces effectiveness. See <a href=\"/products/semi-water-softener-1000l-1500l-tanks\">Semi</a>, <a href=\"/products/centi-water-softener-2000l-2500l-tanks\">Centi</a>, and <a href=\"/blogs/articles/salt-free-vs-salt-based-water-softeners\">salt-free vs salt-based softeners</a>.</p>",
            "category": "Centi"
          }
        },
        "faq_centi_6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "centi",
            "question": "Is Scale-O Centi right for a 2000 litre overhead tank?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Scale-O Centi is built for 2000L-2500L overhead tanks in larger homes with higher daily use. For 1000L-1500L tanks, see <a href=\"/products/semi-water-softener-1000l-1500l-tanks\">Semi</a>.</p>",
            "category": "Centi"
          }
