        "faq_combo_1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "combo",
            "question": "What is a Scale-O combo salt-free water softener for two tanks?",
            "answer": "<p>Combo packs include sized Scale-O units so you can protect two overhead tanks, useful for duplex homes or separate tank lines. Explore <a href=\"/pages/water-softener-plans\">water softener combo plans</a> and the <a href=\"/collections/water-softeners\">water softener for home</a> collection.</p>",
            "category": "Combo"
          }
        },
        "faq_combo_2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "combo",
            "question": "How do I choose Mini, Semi or Centi sizes inside a combo?",
            "answer": "<p>Match each unit to each tank: <a href=\"/products/mini-water-softener-500l-750l-tanks\">Mini 500L-750L</a>, <a href=\"/products/semi-water-softener-1000l-1500l-tanks\">Semi 1000L-1500L</a>, <a href=\"/products/centi-water-softener-2000l-2500l-tanks\">Centi 2000L-2500L</a>. Confirm tank capacities before you buy.</p>",
            "category": "Combo"
          }
        },
        "faq_combo_3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "combo",
            "question": "Do combo units still install without electricity or salt?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Each unit is a salt-free, no-electricity softener placed in its tank. No shared salt plant or wiring. Compare technology in <a href=\"/blogs/articles/salt-free-vs-salt-based-water-softeners\">salt-free vs salt-based water softeners</a>.</p>",
            "category": "Combo"
          }
        },
        "faq_combo_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "combo",
            "question": "Is a combo better than buying one large salt-based softener?",
            "answer": "<p>For homes with two overhead tanks, dedicated tank-level Scale-O units often fit Indian plumbing better than one bulky salt plant. See <a href=\"/pages/water-softener-plans\">plans and pricing</a> and <a href=\"/blogs/articles/best-overhead-tank-water-softener-india\">overhead tank softener</a> guidance.</p>",
            "category": "Combo"
          }
        }
